    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5426" root="جرب" body-key="j">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجرب</span></b>  <i>He had his camels</i> [or <i>found them to
be</i>] <i>affected with what is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرَب</span> [i. e. <i>the
mange,</i> or <i>scab</i>]; (S, A, L, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرِبَ</span></b> ,
(L, K,) which may be for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرِبَتْ إِبِلُهُ</span>; or used
for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجْرَبَ</span>, to assimilate it to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرِبَ</span> in a saying
mentioned above; see 1. (L.)

